summary: mount the previous Kdump NFS export.
description: |
    The testcase it to mount the previous Kdump NFS export and copy the vmcore
    for later vmcore analysis. It can be used in a multihost test or in a single
    host test by specifying your NFS server via param 'NFS_SERVER'.
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - nfs-utils
duration: 90m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/copy-nfs
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/copy-nfs
